<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest cuts three fertilizer cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest cuts three fertilizer cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it downgraded three fertilizer companies.</p>
<p>-- Cut Agrium Inc and Terra Industries Inc to hold from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Cut Mississippi Chemical to accumulate from buy.  </p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Terra shares fell 1/4 to 11-3/4 and Mississippi Chemical rose 5/8 to 22-7/8.  NYSE-listed shares in Agrium were unchanged at 13-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
